msgid "Host bridge"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Host bridge attaches VMs on this network directly to an existing bridge "
"device, giving them LAN visibility. Private NAT creates an isolated internal"
" network with outbound internet access via NAT; VMs on it aren't directly "
"reachable from the LAN."
msgstr ""

msgid "Image"
msgstr "映像"

msgid ""
"Image '%s' is still needed by VM '%s', which hasn't booted yet and would "
"fail to start without it."
msgstr "映像 '%s' 仍被 VM '%s' 所需，該 VM 尚未啟動，如果沒有該映像將無法啟動。"

msgid "Images"
msgstr "映像"

msgid "Imported"
msgstr "已匯入"

msgid "Install cterm"
msgstr "安裝 cterm"

msgid "Installed version"
msgstr "安裝之版本"

msgid ""
"Installs the cterm plugin, which provides the web-based VM console/terminal "
"link. Disable if you manage cterm yourself or don't want a console link."
msgstr "安裝 cterm 插件，該插件提供基於 web 的 VM 控制台/終端機連結。如果您自行管理 cterm 或不需要控制台連結，可將它停用。"

msgid "Keep"
msgstr "保留"

msgid "Keep Recent"
msgstr "保留最近"

msgid ""
"Keep console=ttyS0 — removing it (or pointing it elsewhere) silences the "
"guest's serial console. The VM will still boot and run fine, but the Console"
" log and the cterm terminal will show nothing."
msgstr ""
"保留 console=ttyS0 － 移除它（或將其指向其他位置）會使 VM 客體的串列控制台靜默。VM 仍可正常啟動和執行，但控制台日誌和 cterm"
" 終端機將不顯示任何內容。"

msgid ""
"Keep the most recent number of backups for this VM in this directory. 0 "
"keeps all."
msgstr "此目錄中保留此 VM 最新備份的數目。 0 表示保留所有備份。"

